{"id":"99045f6fdd91d16b","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-measure10-measure-preserving-map.md","title":"ZFC Measure10 Measure Preserving Map","display":"df-zfc-measure10-measure-preserving-map — ZFC Measure10 Measure Preserving Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure10-measure-preserving-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure10-measure-preserving-map"],"display":"df-zfc-measure10-measure-preserving-map — ZFC Measure10 Measure Preserving Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure10-measure-preserving-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure10-measure-preserving-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure10-measure-preserving-map — ZFC Measure10 Measure Preserving Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"39c10f49239bf771\" href=\"?note=39c10f49239bf771\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,X,Y,\\Sigma,\\mathcal{T},\\mu,\\nu\\in V\">\\(f,X,Y,\\Sigma,\\mathcal{T},\\mu,\\nu\\in V\\)</span> (measure-space data and map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (measure-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (relation-preimage predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"39c10f49239bf771\" href=\"?note=39c10f49239bf771\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10MeasurePreservingMap}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10MeasurePreservingMap}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}measure\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10MeasurePreservingMap}_S(f,X,\\Sigma,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal{T},\\nu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(Y,\\mathcal T,\\nu)\\land \\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal{T}\\;\\exists A\\in\\Sigma\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S(A,f,B)\\land\\mu(A)=\\nu(B)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}measure\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10MeasurePreservingMap}_S(f,X,\\Sigma,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal{T},\\nu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(Y,\\mathcal T,\\nu)\\land \\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal{T}\\;\\exists A\\in\\Sigma\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S(A,f,B)\\land\\mu(A)=\\nu(B)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every measurable inverse image is supplied by the canonical relation-preimage predicate, so no unbound inverse-image operator is used.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md","status":"resolved","id":"39c10f49239bf771","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerp